# TPFanControl ignore rules.
#
# Everything here is generated, local, or machine-specific. Nothing in this file
# may match a source file, a resource, the canonical example profile, or the
# reviewed vendor import library.
#
# See docs/IMPLEMENTATION_CHECKLIST.md tasks T0-01 … T0-05 and ADR-016.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A stale .obj can satisfy a link step without the corresponding source having
# been recompiled, which is how a broken build becomes a passing one.
[Bb]uild/
[Oo]ut/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.obj
*.o
*.pch
*.ipch
*.idb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.res
*.tlb
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.unsuccessfulbuild

# Visual Studio user state and databases
.vs/
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.suo
*.user
*.sdf
*.opensdf
.vscode/
.idea/

# Compiled binaries
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb

# NOTE: *.lib is deliberately NOT ignored. fancontrol/TVicPort.lib is the
# reviewed vendor import described in SECURITY.md section 3 and is required to
# link. Ignoring it would silently break the build for a fresh clone.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The application writes logs, CSV traces and a working copy of its profile
# next to the executable. Those are local state, never source.
*.log
*_csv.txt
*_last_csv.txt

# A runtime INI copy is local state. The canonical example profile is the
# tracked fancontrol/TPFanControl.ini and is NOT matched by these rules.
fancontrol/Debug/*.ini
fancontrol/Debug/*.ini.local
fancontrol/Release/*.ini
fancontrol/Release/*.ini.local
fancontrol/Backup/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test and tool output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The portable test harness builds into a temporary directory, but keep a
# pattern here so a manual in-tree build cannot be committed by accident.
tpfancontrol-core-test/
tpfancontrol-core-san/
core_tests
core_tests.exe
ec_protocol_tests
ec_protocol_tests.exe
*.sarif
*.diag.xml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials and secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The project has no network component and must never acquire one without a
# decision record. These patterns are defence in depth.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.keystore
credentials.json
secrets.json

# Python bytecode from the CI helper scripts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor and OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*~
*.bak
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
